{ A narrow Gaussian pulse in the rhs at time = 1. An adaptive controller that
  walks in with a large step MUST reject and retry; the rejection policy
  (factor, min/max clamp, whether the rejected step is counted) is what this
  document compares. }
DYNAMIC pulse (method = ode45, time = 0 .. 2, points = 41)
  der(Yv) = 200*exp(-20000*(time - 1)^2) - 0.5*Yv
  Yv(0) = 0
END
